'''Subaru Hoshi''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] who was added in [[Version 6.8 Update|Version 6.8]] and can be unlocked from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event]]. His [[True Form]] was added in the same update which improves stats and range but also increases TBA and attack animation.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 394
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Subaru Hoshi
|name2 = Subaru Hoshi CC
|name3 = Dark Subaru CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Subaru Hoshi CC''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Dark Subaru CC''' using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
Subaru is a long-ranged unit that can be super useful in situations like sniping enemies in the back. He has high DPS, and good abilities, to allow himself to be used in most stages. Unfortunately, Subaru has a blind spot, he also has high speed, so you may need to use tanks like [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]], as they can protect him from his speed.

Another strategy is using him with [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|AoE attackers]] with good range like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] or [[Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS (Gacha Event)|ULTRA SOULS]] Ubers.

Subaru can cripple [[Sunfish Jones]] under the right circumstances, so using him against it is very effective.

{{Job|Classification = Backliner & Sniper}}

